Z||000000||Neverfinished||04-16-2001||06:04 PM||||I found a way to mate a garage door and wood framing into the front end of my car. Heres the steps...<BR>leave your e-brake on while you drive for a minute...<BR>pull into your driveway...<BR>pull up your now weakened e-brake...<BR>lock your car and hop into a buddies car...<BR>come home 2 hours later and see your f***N car rammed 3 feet into your house...<BR>anyone with a big sloped driveway can do this and it takes little effort and brains.<P>good thing my dad is a body man and fixed the front end before I woke up the ext day after a hard night of drinking.<BR>cheers...||||reg||1
